, 2026, the Premier League published the Commission's findings. It described disguised owner funding through commercial arrangements and inaccurate financial reporting during the affected period. City rejects the findings and has appealed. Sanctions remain to be decided separately. That is significant new context for old financial arguments. It is not permission to treat every claim made by every rival as proven. Then Klopp was asked about it. Here was the man whose team had twice finished a point behind City, the man who had joked about a parade. The obvious ending would be a victory lap. He played down the celebration. His respect for the football remained. The final reaction complicates the simple idea that this is only about getting another medal.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}